# Committed, non-secret build defaults. Anything private belongs in `.env.local`,
# which is gitignored and overrides this file.
#
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key. Public by design — it is inlined into the
# client bundle at build time and visible to every visitor. It lives here rather
# than only in `.env.local` because the Worker rebuilds on every push to main,
# from a checkout that has no `.env.local`: a build without this key cannot
# obtain a captcha token, and Supabase then refuses every sign-in, sign-up, code
# resend and password reset. See docs/auth-protection.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAEi26ehlxHqidXTp
